export anchor ScrapbookCollageStyle:
    number: 35
    screen: TaskBoard
    name: Scrapbook collage
    idea: The board as a scrapbook spread, with torn paper scraps, washi tape, label-maker strips and rubber stamps pasted onto a kraft board.
    base: light
    palette:
        board: #d9c4a0, the page with faint fibre stripes
        kraft: #c9a877, the To do scrap
        cream: #fffcf2, lined paper, notes and the style sheet
        tissuePink: #f7d9dc, the In progress scrap and one cut title letter block
        graph: #f4f9f1, the Review scrap with a #cfe3c8 16px grid
        newsprint: #ece8de, the Done scrap
        sticky: #fbeea0, sticky note cards
        manila: #f2e0ad, the filter tags
        ink: #2a211a, text and count chips
        pencil: #5a4a3b, small caps labels
        labelTape: #1c1c1c, the brand strip and the Add task button, with white text
        stampRed: #b3261e, the At risk and Overdue stamps
        stampGreen: #2d6a2d, the Done stamp
        navy: #1f3a6b, focus
        tape: #faf4d6, washi tape strips at 72 percent opacity
    type:
        Georgia, Times New Roman, serif bold for headings and card titles,
        and Courier New, Courier, American Typewriter, monospace for body
        and labels. The title is cut letters at 34 to 40px, one word each in
        serif, typewriter and serif italic. Column titles are 22px serif
        bold, card titles 17px serif bold, body 14px typewriter, field
        labels 11 to 12px uppercase with 0.08em tracking. The brand is 16px
        bold uppercase typewriter with 0.18em tracking.
    layout:
        A brand label-maker strip top left, tilted, and a small white
        polaroid tag with MO and Mara Okafor top right. The title Mobile app
        2.0 is three cut paper blocks beside a tilted red At risk stamp.
        Filters are manila luggage tags with a punched hole, a lined paper
        search strip with a red margin, and the black Add task strip at the
        right. Four torn-edged scraps of different paper hold the columns,
        each tilted under a degree with washi tape on top. Cards are index
        cards, sticky notes, receipts with zigzag bottoms and torn notes,
        each tilted about 1.3 degrees, with a dashed round points sticker
        and a two column list of Label, Who and Due. Below 1040px two
        columns, below 640px one.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px between notes, 24px between scraps, 24px padding inside scraps.
    density: Loose. Paper needs room to tilt and overlap.
    corners:
        Square paper with torn, zigzag or receipt edges cut by clip-path.
        The filter tags have a pointed left end. Only the points sticker
        and the Done stamp are round.
    borders: None on paper. Stamps have 3px outlines in their ink. Fields use a 2px dashed underline.
    shadows: Paste shadows, a drop-shadow of 1px 2px 1.5px in rgba of 40,25,5 at 0.35, with scraps tilted between minus 1.4 and 1.2 degrees.
    icons:
        Bold 2.2 stroke line icons at text size, mostly inside stamps.
        Overdue and At risk are a triangle in a red rectangular stamp. Done
        is a tick in a green oval stamp. Comments use a speech box.
    focus: A 3px navy outline offset 3px. A focused field gets a solid navy underline and a pale blue fill.
    tone: Crafty and short, with typewriter labels such as Who, Due and Notes.
